        "person_id": "t8a_uoo_qhb",
        "source_quote": "循遣將英紏為上饒令，千餘人守故城，進攻破之。",
        "reading": "循署英紏上饒令，為虞丘進所破。",
        "note": "循署英紏上饒令，為虞丘進所破。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 129,
        "end_codepoint": 151,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:received_sentence2-151",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "t8a_uoo_qhb",
        "source_quote": "循又遣童敏之為鄱陽太守，據郡，進從餘干步道趣鄱陽，敏之退走，追破之，斬首數百。",
        "reading": "循署童敏之鄱陽太守，為進所敗。",
        "note": "循署童敏之鄱陽太守，為進所敗。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 151,
        "end_codepoint": 190,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:received_sentence2-190",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "t8a_uoo_qhb",
        "source_quote": "復隨劉藩至始興，討斬徐道覆。",
        "reading": "從劉藩等斬徐道覆。",
        "note": "從劉藩等斬徐道覆。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 190,
        "end_codepoint": 204,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "t8a_uoo_qhb",
        "source_quote": "八年，除寧蠻護軍、尋陽太守，領文武二千從征劉毅。",
        "reading": "義熙八年寧蠻護軍、尋陽太守，從征劉毅；二千人有異文。",
        "note": "義熙八年寧蠻護軍、尋陽太守，從征劉毅；二千人有異文。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 24,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:received_sentence3-24",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "t8a_uoo_qhb",
        "source_quote": "事平，補太尉行參軍，尋加振威將軍。",
        "reading": "補太尉行參軍、振威將軍。",
        "note": "補太尉行參軍、振威將軍。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 24,
        "end_codepoint": 41,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-049-yuqiujin:received_sentence3-41",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "t8a_uoo_qhb",
        "source_quote": "九年，以前後功封望蔡縣男，食邑五百戶，加龍驤將軍。",
        "reading": "九年封望蔡縣男，邑五百戶。",
